{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1509,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec78d7daad9df79f2fd2c128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位、果然实力非凡呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29acac6c9863fe9046c8090aedfdf10e3791f81ef3c3aa31e2a77412d57e5745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa19253762451504396a9ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从百货店订购了一些\r\n跨年时要吃的小菜拼盘。\r\n方便的话请您也一同来委员会办公室吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32007d316c1a29a89b38f71c814af18d412b42b909270245a4d13164e824963e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:288f6d8f48e7fd313cf495fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝您生日快乐。\r\n我已将贺礼送至您的房间\r\n和您的老家。还请笑纳",
      "source_fingerprint": "7013285cc56a69db58407cc4a545b822bf3b42ad56297020da948441601dda40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:439b82416320c5c8f05ca793",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使在这样的日子也依然挂念着我吗\r\n…真是拿您没办法。――那就由我、\r\n为您献上一场最极致的美梦吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cd4f516374d7b95d94ccdb8e76b3896bbd32db60d386d2580f0a874f451aef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efa83a2aae1956eb35e961dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日这天我定会与家人共进晚餐的。\r\n只要我下厨款待…\r\n他们就会很高兴呦，非常高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "256fd8842adf59e0bc56c3d1f8cbe3dcc8896171cdca435c284893fa7faaa2a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9571baec86f5b98029b094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身边的人们能在今天展露笑颜…\r\n这便是最好的礼物了。\r\n所以来吧…让我好好看看您的脸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c80d5827937d5f7e38903807dbc2d6b2d0b2f6df793ba7932184c9fce06cde0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ad1425b901f616ffeec81d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有通知发来了，\r\n还是建议您尽早确认为好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df7df1595d9b49565dcedf0f3c8d1149d409eee6e2c7b8e7bd8b7df71441a5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd457306632d1c2e3ed8ae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物送到了呢。\r\n请您仔细地确认一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6213cd0a0ababc6ad85dcf2819d6249fa865d76e545dbca8745707d5dd38358f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc4f307cac39fdf1e4fd988",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如此繁多的任务\r\n您竟然已经都完成了？\r\n真是出色的工作表现呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44f04215d4f558e9fcdc0a95390d368387b7dfad1bf9986e1a15ba78b42a4527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb82f5b33f1cd50e98d3a0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近似乎会有活动呢。\r\n必须细致地准备才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0cd74dd22a00fccd2a57f26f5ede31c606306c21e16e3abffe07e8f7cbb4ca4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb47b92418cb42a23bdff48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动、真是热闹呢。\r\n也请您，务必尽情享受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3c277352f70afe798d9de06e4ea2e539bb01928e92616b9c70ba2f628847a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32bc2fbbd96aaad5b5d15570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是遗憾啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "408a4b1a59ef75d7ec7942f3ff3d6f2198ae36cd18c781eb43f82fe008f96684",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd315b594e388aedf54b0cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n貌似提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e034f76defb703a513e574851f38506fd1cac2a291ccec8a9e3c7504667a658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:867a245b2da9baf2004d6c92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确实强大的对手…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3121eaf5f9c894dc288c23203f122253c4335abf3282993188ef3b80e76cef99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67570401cc3bc0390c19896e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是了不起的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fefdadaa2cab8bf6d520d76bcb87fc54de20def88591cfec6de4b2ebcd818cb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:236f7ef40142a3d6208e4600",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是遗憾啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "408a4b1a59ef75d7ec7942f3ff3d6f2198ae36cd18c781eb43f82fe008f96684",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15f57744e7acaccd379c135f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确实强大的对手…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3121eaf5f9c894dc288c23203f122253c4335abf3282993188ef3b80e76cef99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bac5d12b07ae6ff8f6bbde2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是努力奋斗的赏赐呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7613cf02532ab7f2034be67dac42980fdedc76c12909a2c04e5fa5148df18d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10bdb77c1e36c78fdb74dc62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们奉献一场精彩的比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a25bed0b58c785dccce70855a3a78734e9e7a4620dfc818f328204670c8c538",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae679f2e59ba7bc08c94fc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175b1ee217ae05684803caf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是训练呢。我们\r\n先商量下具体地内容吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf371262549ec920b3df3482a357331c11c46e3983dff149b11ac31013d2523f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:848f15ceea2f1e3194e5c37a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家的旅途记录…不知能否\r\n也看到大姐头的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4347aea39b93c18955ae2d696846b364c62cc19ae8b035e5ee45202cbfdf2894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd4eec4f8077202e17b1b60b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "细致周全的做好出战准备…\r\n全力以赴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c89c3b565b1725c45571e36d7dbc6f94a811487de8559fb59340fa3a58fde885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c308f40a033096b3eebc7a90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘、Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00a332dbf66fe7440c85b54cb8cfc4c7f3ec6ba969be0a83c7f65e98076dfb46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50037b03b5bc996360f904ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ…満たされるようです…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59ef84ce1e16d0f0a17fae384a968f9c56d0e7ce193ab9016656b0de90937335",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e96c824fbbb140de513f6a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我全押了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "494cd35128e3ff8b0a378da8229b5ad0471d3e424956e740e1474e3889cbc305",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "1208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba016678c4122bcf7aa7928d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f70910ba3a869bfe745d5d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ってくださいね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32b4258e96412aa922b962c88008100a4082a9c25115c59654921baeb3d622ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b05f035b2c28c472f0b5b51f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりましたね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d556c74211441a4c0c2f4fd74c5364a8a9f8ac3ceba5c7bba0ba63b648ba9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7374a84e949a8f73bbbd648a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おやおや…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db4167e116f0bb4f3ea36ec6b90e73c87fbf1524f6cfa970473ea9486d058620",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6dfa6ea5c4ac393681bda53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素晴らしい腕前です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d317e43181aec7d06823832e0ba52e25e61f0bf3df5353951aee3ff775dbc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23cdb0f60956d30d5b219ddc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さすがですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25f95f432bc7b7a9b43caf7035a2f79bed4ac30fdf385940607a560e71415905",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48859049bd76681723d864f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そうお気を落とさずに。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b895e9f101115c5881b70c62f9debb70fb377050a8c71ebf00d9f8fad81bbc2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6935911dc76495fba5ab477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素晴らしい腕前です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d317e43181aec7d06823832e0ba52e25e61f0bf3df5353951aee3ff775dbc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aed9f77a4e8cef3383a35fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さすがですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25f95f432bc7b7a9b43caf7035a2f79bed4ac30fdf385940607a560e71415905",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de5a73cfd3ddd657dc6e310",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おや。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d527ddfde5f851070ed8b9e3bcb7f14df4c20533388e1fe073a8c5ee9b7a3a80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:944680d2e842037555176047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なるほど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6060d825a6076f13a47cc304d64491b431764116f93db22e8a3eb419858f2a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c77ed337e600f09d31e3c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふむ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc85de9baa6672c2c81baee59b07561bae8d6e1b887a3e92e1cd1b692282626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bda306bb68ecde9bed0e5cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お上手ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5551379344b2bfb99ff361091e3669c1ca3b2b61b848d17298403469f5e7a88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bcc2f1c0abdd2848ebdc356",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好機ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "676aec7b3347e4708c903dd0215803efd0949e05cc373668f8d953382461e2a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9a903039d1480f404725dca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これはこれは。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40062912b08bda40e0d8b2307c75ab0a7beeb6e2361f8f3deb75a1a70d0eca20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c66c1949547d51c442a894f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おっと…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "474809821850a54e3de21fe795b5c0bfdd2920b2416c4c272720287bc6117fe3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abfef37f2687e506b98fd63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2452670a30426d87a4d948ebde001f06e583a789f5f8d913ea33347f767de96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:193afbd4c32205c5403fb499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どうなさいました？",
      "source_fingerprint": "382e324f68d619cf5a2a4ed018d9e10e85e6473abd3f45d56c00f2d5835c551b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b8543e31b271313914a6ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おや、残念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdbee5f925f46d5939579cd54c69e9627fe55c4df089b0e8c2c424d073fd768d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089e710933de7a25e0837f29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "惜しいですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe2abc3da56d00993c092f561d7cad51b3524a1923903f840ccde16544f83f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b4539e8ba736109fe04aa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天我会为您准备这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8246de2c2722b6f157d8fee86c93e37548f1cede2d3327a483206008441fe3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:568eec4155fff732e901eef3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――呼…啊、非常抱歉。\r\n那个…我没事的，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bac688cfbe7d41bd5420cc6578d7b81db24ced7deb4e5df3826f90cfd83f337",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fbe776a3f3e6f8a7e0fe2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做凡事都不应超过其限度…\r\n您想必也是这么想的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "706fa421cddadbf929ae68d41377ff271e1fcbe6eaf883c76d61d2a8201c8ab1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ce87f3cc504e70a3ebb4be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…状态正好。感觉离大姐头\r\n所在的地方、又靠近了一些…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "197ec91d3e3863fb9445c9f1490d72613730556eb49c61c8a37f6bcc472061bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2a80b46e91b894083f6481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来今天也能进行\r\n一场富有成效的训练呢。\r\n还请多多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "206bb7df67cc37b1e848a869d3ed24b073cea22e083a318bdfeac07c33c8cc47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deb957debd832678cb92406e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小匠的跑法还是如此凌厉、\r\n却又如此美丽…。呵呵;\r\n我也不能落后呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d48e65710504db92763626c5d38af5dcc93b0861576d2aa88c2a82fdbe5828f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96aceae6690926fd65be0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的鼎力相助、\r\n实在的帮了我大忙。\r\n今天也请多多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "453d1b6639beffa1d9d8c7e02e1cb99d4ae4062600c06e783a2dfb0a13849afa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb7dbf80d8e61ce07883b6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一步一个脚印\r\n稳步前进吧。\r\n毕竟旅途当中，最忌讳焦躁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c218c720412669f34a302f54c546d3f2164f6a63a88e2581019d6dda5873a3c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d73aef32186416a24c891932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "停滞不前亦有原因――\r\n唯有探明前因后果\r\n方为训练的真谛…您说对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "858eaede725c1111f0b1e18b935a4384bbbde387cebf0338faa9cbf514bcc840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6bf73a783ba03bd1f4df02c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讲真、状态说不上很好…。\r\n真是，太不争气了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7c6daf6afbc48653e982466da5219d1fb5ea7f1b60077e198cc87382c269ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b01f1dfe9967473a5c3f5a64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "针对每种状态的对策\r\n我都已考虑过了。还请\r\n您务必放心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66596d0cb721334c233ba5006f9f5f6ffa2f7e5381fef82d985b5593eef7f978",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e478117abf64174fd3d1667c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以目前的状态，训练效率\r\n恐怕难以符合理想。该如何\r\n应对…能和您商量一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dfc35347c637d40335bbe514962766b60bf1a8a9bbf458a1282b807ec945e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc8fa7d502dff09b3330101e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日依旧、只需\r\n按部就班即可。…还有别的事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1edab2ae83e0232e6beb015bebd037dba1dfb607e441c0594fdfc9103f4eb6f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3dc999e5eb4ab1dbd96622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多该聊聊关于\r\n日程安排的事了。来、坐下说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00dcad3b45bbe604ea917f9c62a38e8c39ada332290718f0041889309e2d53de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb8c981b899f0d8db7ed16a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…您明白的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f455c8d25fa5280a8a9c10e7ef642079818fa1acb600a4871060df56e57f20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de1e2aa0ffe9acbba3638da9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐头曾目睹过的景色…\r\n今天是否也能，窥见到一二呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34574326bd248a0ab957912cbd9b642d2863ce0725c998358f21bcd1caed23c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692407de646e5f920921bce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让您体验一下\r\n何为极致的旅程吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "413c4221931e5594b3a0a9383b84a77016234e0a7ddd938a8a59fc27a57cfe8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c57dac89e65a59f5ab5044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整完毕…您也做得\r\n非常出色。今天我会\r\n让您见证精彩的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fd1d87c5b9cd0616faa11ebc3256cf09d1fd58bb76a1aee566bebd011af2c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f3455ac57192ba507a3645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整万无一失、对手的情报收集\r\n也已周全。接下来…\r\n就只待夺取胜利、了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "404a08d604ecd9bb461c61ab2f2765fb6fb6674581a6ea508b25864c7007c2e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4855538c7b4f2f6101fda054",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利的滋味…那份芳香。\r\n让我们前去尽情享受吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85abe917ee260aa18f755576fc9bbb21da39916d8294c997c3b57b3932cd47d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7139c282144e91276ef41f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，身体如此轻盈。\r\n――仿佛能翱翔天际一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a579eafc7f4e02568eb54d3124641475f4284b5897121a5c372c89cead9473",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc90352f4be78d5de8a431d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就，从容不迫地…\r\n去夺取胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff244ea33b1d2ee59be90ae2942c11edc1b47cd52077381e1526ddf5c173a873",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79209919473fe45fd536523f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该做的都已经做了。\r\n剩下的、便是如何将其尽数发挥…\r\n这就是我自己的问题了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c2eb38e4de301594739a3f7b657bdb9cd7fd584ce916939ca1cbe5f1d84abc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c4e378a3bacba5066328a7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧张、么。\r\n呵…说得真可爱。\r\n不过是展现实力罢了，仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18db8129f730a0db34032ce63d4eefe68a6c5f73943d24878d456b29cf5dbe7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e80fd3b9208403091ee8cb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调整不足…或许这也是\r\n竞赛生涯中常有的事吧。\r\n我会妥善应对的，绝无疏漏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b048d88b7b1eedc17d6939580a4d1db27d404fb3c2932cfb1e73d4b7ebad1177",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d66f01a1053ec2ee2169293",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "复盘和总结留待一切结束之后。\r\n――现在，要全力以赴地\r\n应对眼前的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2cf6d7fcb738a949926ea7ceea8e1398aec681e5ee8c88f0a3705edc652f002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a9a2a7d1a36a705453dfa4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系、我很集中。\r\n将此刻所能拥有的力量全部倾注于战斗――\r\n这才是面对胜负之事应有的姿态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f5b9f1302a66ecf41871e98b2ea0a57500453e53d6fbf0dd5bf7b38cfbf5fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd07d477e72ec0f6dbe297e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼――――…不，\r\n没问题。我们上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cbabf3dbd9b3a827bcb2100ba867ab9fd8861dbbd14923811264d081b4c896c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807221598655ec2fb7478bf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱歉。能稍微\r\n给我点集中精力的时间吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e0e1f66f30b024beeb659bb98d96b4367444f0feffc5f9c5d1cfd788e4bb4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41565f3509c13a0d685c4774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老实说、这恐怕会是场\r\n严酷的比赛吧。关键在于，能从中\r\n收获到什么，并延续到下一段旅途",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de7865fee309423d75d9decc8d4e02e0afcdc5061cc45a36da604f2ce6482dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8358a871a928c71f51daa41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "639ec917f68ca8864ddb2ad4eb800eccca968da99504ad48a5e78de236d94f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b8e19f749251b91ec11f4f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980a7ec4edfa6d1adf15641f4347f9c2840126ff143da4b3a0db3ad63034d737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3ad8f9517a272e2fc6b9e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无妨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b932bccdd0e2ec3b6f0fee7d20a5284305f9a8b1bea3ce2f1333ff63447fd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c2d966d0221f28a12c5052d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e8d20aa5151334b4c38a65a505a9374b636972b6acc835853e25c1ff32890f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1119",
        "20041"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
